From: Codex ODS Maintainer <codex-maintainer@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 04:05:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(cron): enforce registered command admission and
 owned cleanup

Add a generic direct-command lifecycle hook so owner plugins can reserve activity before spawn and retain cleanup until process-group exit is proven. Keep agent cron separate and preserve unmanaged no-hook behavior. Required startup policy and conversation permissions remain enforced.

Qualified in isolated Tower2 candidate: 109 focused tests, core and test typechecks, type-aware lint, formatting, full build and fresh structured review passed. Native Windows and installed ODS integration are not qualified by this commit.
